    "causal_summary": "sk-design is a design parent hub with three modes. sk-design-md-generator measures a live surface's real CSS into a validated Style Reference DESIGN.md. sk-design-chart picks the chart form that answers a reader's question and builds it as one self-contained HTML file. sk-design-diagram builds flowcharts and text, HTML, SVG, Mermaid and draw.io diagrams. Deciding UI values and reviewing a screen belong to sk-code's frontend surface.",
